"Events last 53 turns on average: Democritus 52, Egidious 53, Cassian 55. Beasts slain per event: 7.5.":"Ereignisse dauern im Schnitt 53 Züge: Democritus 52, Egidious 53, Cassian 55. Erlegte Bestien pro Ereignis: 7,5.",
"Events last {0} turns on average: Democritus {1}, Egidious {2}, Cassian {3}. Beasts slain per event: {4}.":"Ereignisse dauern im Schnitt {0} Züge: Democritus {1}, Egidious {2}, Cassian {3}. Erlegte Bestien pro Ereignis: {4}.",
"Every 3 trophies held by a winner add 5 CF at the end. {0} in total.":"Je 3 Trophäen eines Siegers bringen am Ende 5 CF. Insgesamt {0}.",
